			"Message": "style(Output): Normalize esbuild output formatting across Configuration\n\nConsolidate the compiled JavaScript artifacts under Configuration/ to a uniform code style produced by the esbuild pipeline. Every file is affected by three mechanical changes:\n\n1. Hoist the `__defProp`/`__name` helper shim declarations above all static import statements so the module preamble reads consistently regardless of import count.\n2. Convert indentation from tab-based to 2-space throughout — object literals, array entries, callback bodies, and case clauses now use the same two-space indent as the `Source/` TypeScript originals.\n3. Strip trailing commas from final array/object entries and normalise export blocks to a multi-line `export { ... };` shape.\n\nNo runtime behaviour changes; the transforms (Apply, Copy, Polyfill, Transform, Replace, Rewrite, Strip, Inject, Patch, Instrument) and polyfill shims (Process, FileSystem, IPC, NativeModule, ChildProcess, SharedProcess) are semantically identical before and after.",
			"SHA": "a0b1315b674d1171f639d41ab235149675edf5ec"
